doc:FactsarticleXgBoostPmsm dcterms:description "Data-driven diagnostic system using XGBoost to detect, classify, and assess severity of multiple faults in permanent magnet synchronous motors (PMSMs). Discriminative electrical features retrieved from stator currents, flux linkage, and dq-axis values; aggregated diagnostic index created to facilitate diagnosis and severity quantification in a single learning process. XGBoost model shows high diagnostic accuracy, robust separation between fault causes, and dependable performance under previously unknown operating/fault conditions." .
_:c27ee115723e24fdb3494df4a2e374d8 rdf:reifies <<( doc:FactsarticleXgBoostPmsm dcterms:description "Data-driven diagnostic system using XGBoost to detect, classify, and assess severity of multiple faults in permanent magnet synchronous motors (PMSMs). Discriminative electrical features retrieved from stator currents, flux linkage, and dq-axis values; aggregated diagnostic index created to facilitate diagnosis and severity quantification in a single learning process. XGBoost model shows high diagnostic accuracy, robust separation between fault causes, and dependable performance under previously unknown operating/fault conditions." )>> ;
